// B05, the Ossuary Keeper (registry 34000-34999). Source: docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md,
// "B05 Ossuary Keeper" (HP 3,000, two phases, weakness Blunt and Radiance, immune to Poison and
// Rupture, the Bone Sentinel Echo as its reward, an Echo Stone in the arena). Defense, poise,
// resist, attack, stamina, option weights, and cooldowns are tuning.
//
// The adds are parts that aren't required to win. All of them lie "dead" until the Keeper raises
// them (`ai::bosses::b05`): three bone thralls on Raise, and two Drowned when the water rises in
// phase 2. The core also locks three options by cooldown until their condition holds: Raise needs
// a fallen thrall, the scavenge needs a fallen thrall and an unarmed Keeper, and the borrowed
// moves need an armed one. The reward's Echo is unlocked by `ai::bosses::b05` on defeat (the boss file has no flag field).
#![enable(implicit_some)]
(
  id: "b05_ossuary_keeper",
  name: "The Ossuary Keeper",
  body: (
    id: "b05_ossuary_keeper_body",
    model: "boss_ossuary_keeper",
    hp: 3000,
    poise: 300,
    defense: (flat: 25, weakness: [(Blunt, 120), (Radiance, 120)]),
    resist: (immunity: 400, robustness: 400, composure: 400),
    immune: [Poison, Rupture],
    glimmer: 0,
    attack: 100,
